Package: mytical-sddm-theme
Version: 0.1.0-1~resolute1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mytical <dev@mytical.invalid>
Depends: sddm, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-effects, qml6-module-qtmultimedia, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, fonts-open-sans
Description: Mytical SDDM theme
 Astronaut-derived SDDM theme for Mytical, with Mytical colors, a default
 CC0 background and the QML dependencies SDDM needs. The theme is installed
 under /usr/share/sddm/themes/mytical and owned by root.
